"������q���K��\u001e����w�.�պ��y�[\b\u0000�\u0004E5�����*i\u0018��u\u0001��Ӈ7u_\u001fpy���&�W�{w⻊\u0000\u0000~�O)&On>Wa� u�\u0000\u0002�Vol��-���F{�\ru���D/\u0000��B�\u0011�K\u001e�|���Ÿ�\u00070[�\u0010C}�\u0014�[�����oZ��q��%sT��\u0001\u0000|Q�~5yx��+\u0017\"�\u0001�F���w}=��^��m\r��,��Km\u0000\u0000>H�i \u000fo�F�E��\u0003\bl,�5x����)���e�cI�޽��qm(��\u0004\u0000�\r�1ƹ�\u0010y~�\n�\u0007p�\u000f��\u0010\u0003�g�$�{u�M��\r����5KT*��\u0000\u0000\u0001�ֹ�<��P�u�x�\u0007�\u0017���R���^�\u0005y��q]�����u��\n\n...1204997 bytes truncated...\n\nThe tool call succeeded but the output was truncated. Full output saved to: /home/hal/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_15b683731001lYBfleBn4sjKI4\nUse Grep to search the full content or Read with offset/limit to view specific sections."
