sduction and develop proprietary cell lines for assays.\" I cannot confirm from the binary dump. Let me search for the poster or use a text-converting proxy? Maybe r.jina.ai? Not available maybe. Try fetching with format text — the PDF parse produced binary. Could try Google cache? Let's try search for the phrase.\n\nAlso p1:activity 8 abstracts detail: search the Voyager May 13 2026 release for the poster list. But the cited source is Q2 release; the Q2 release says \"Eight presentations at ASGCT 2026: Voyager's presentations included ... multiple poster presentations.\" Doesn't mention receptor-based potency assay cell lines. So PARTIAL anyway. Unless the full Q2 release has more bullets? The item says \"the capsid discovery team presented eight ASGCT 2026 abstracts including receptor-based potency-assay cell lines\" — the Q2 release doesn't mention cell lines; but the May 2026 poster exists (p1:c4 source), which is a receptor-based stable cell lines poster. Still not on the Q2 page. PARTIAL.\n\nLet me search for the p1:c4 quote phrase to confirm it appears on that poster."
